                     placed into Q-register Z (or X or Y depending on version) then\par
                     the Macro Z (MZ) command is executed to start the contents of\par
                     Q-register Z.  In some versions of TECO (including TECOC), this\par
                     is accomplished using a "hidden" Q-register.  As such, the full\par
                     complement of 36 Q-registers is always available.\par
